00:25:55.180 --> 00:25:58.020
You know, very delicate, very delicate stuff.

496
00:25:58.580 --> 00:26:02.520
And boy, I mean, and how that romance captured everybody in America.

497
00:26:02.700 --> 00:26:04.060
Man, we were rooting for you.

498
00:26:05.280 --> 00:26:06.560
I mean, yeah.

499
00:26:07.200 --> 00:26:15.820
Well, I just know in my own life, I feel such gratitude that my parents supported my dream

500
00:26:15.820 --> 00:26:17.160
of being an actor.

501
00:26:17.160 --> 00:26:21.200
Like, my key relationships supported me.

502
00:26:21.200 --> 00:26:27.180
Like, I always felt like on each step of the journey, there was at least one person who

503
00:26:27.180 --> 00:26:28.560
was telling me I could do it.

504
00:26:28.960 --> 00:26:31.660
