00:28:04.460 --> 00:28:05.120
Had a blaSt.

546
00:28:05.340 --> 00:28:05.620
Wow.

547
00:28:05.880 --> 00:28:06.080
Yeah.

548
00:28:06.300 --> 00:28:07.460
Really amazing play.

549
00:28:09.020 --> 00:28:11.480
And then he said, you should apply to Yale Drama School.

