00:29:26.880 --> 00:29:29.460
But like, go back and like, reshoot boys and girls.

580
00:29:29.620 --> 00:29:31.840
Like, just experience it and live it.

581
00:29:31.920 --> 00:29:34.460
With this perspective after all these years.

582
00:29:34.620 --> 00:29:34.880
Yes.

583
00:29:34.880 --> 00:29:35.120
Yes.

584
00:29:35.120 --> 00:29:37.800
I would love to sit in a party planning committee scene.

585
00:29:38.000 --> 00:29:39.880
It would make me so happy.

