00:29:48.780 --> 00:29:55.580
And I also think like, I don't know if there's like a, I don't want to undo the bow that we

591
00:29:55.580 --> 00:30:00.080
put on the end of it by like, figuring out a way that all these people are back in the

592
00:30:00.080 --> 00:30:00.740
office again.

593
00:30:01.100 --> 00:30:01.400
Yeah.

594
00:30:01.820 --> 00:30:06.360
Like, so we just treasure it, you know, but doing this podcast, it feels like we get

595
00:30:06.360 --> 00:30:07.860
to revisit it a little bit.

596
00:30:07.940 --> 00:30:08.200
Of course.

597
00:30:08.480 --> 00:30:08.960
Of course.

598
00:30:18.930 --> 00:30:23.950
And I wanted to ask you, with your directing experience, when you joined The Office,

