00:32:47.530 --> 00:32:52.450
You just have to have it because it's such a high wire act what you guys were doing.

644
00:32:52.450 --> 00:32:53.490
It's so dangerous.

645
00:32:53.890 --> 00:32:55.050
That's when it got great.

