00:33:36.670 --> 00:33:39.810
I loved just seeing Kevin in the background.

664
00:33:40.390 --> 00:33:46.090
Once he said that he would back up Jim if Roy came for him, just how Brian played like this

665
00:33:46.090 --> 00:33:48.050
tension throughout the episode.

666
00:33:48.430 --> 00:33:49.130
Like, whew.

667
00:33:49.710 --> 00:33:49.950
Yeah.

668
00:33:50.410 --> 00:33:50.550
Yeah.

669
00:33:50.650 --> 00:33:51.630
Didn't break into that.

670
00:33:51.750 --> 00:33:52.230
All of that.

