00:34:47.850 --> 00:34:53.990
But, uh, we did have a little cabaret theater and we did have a lot of classes in improvisation

688
00:34:53.990 --> 00:34:56.470
and it just taught me so much.

689
00:34:56.570 --> 00:35:01.770
I, I always like to do an improv pass and I try to, I tell my people, you know, let's make

